function lit(v){if(v===null||v===undefined)return 'NULL';if(typeof v==='number')return Number.isFinite(v)?String(v):'NULL';if(typeof v==='boolean')return v?'TRUE':'FALSE';if(typeof v==='object'){const s=JSON.stringify(v).replace(/'/g,"''");return `'${s}'::jsonb`;}const s=String(v).replace(/'/g,"''");return `'${s}'`;}
const r=$json;const values=cols.map(c=>lit(r[c]));
